page to retry.":[689.6216,5.3968],"s:Find cleared.":[695.2184,0.9232],"s:Stopped looking.":[696.3416,0.9328],"s:Tell me what to look for, for example a chair or the exit.":[697.4744,3.1108],"s:Reading.":[700.7852,0.5993],"s:I can't read any text here.":[701.5845,1.4209],"s:The camera is off. Start it first.":[703.2054,1.9523],"s:Sorry, reading failed. Check the connection to the SeeForMe server and try again.":[705.3576,4.7495],"s:Goodbye. Hands-free voice is off.":[710.3071,1.8905],"s:Sound off.":[712.3976,0.7221],"s:Sound on.":[713.3197,0.6997],"s:Read mode.":[714.2193,0.758],"s:Navigate mode.":[715.1774,1.0362],"s:Navigate mode. Scene descriptions follow automatically when you stand still.":[716.4136,4.3068],"s:Automatic: Navigate mode.":[720.9203,1.7401],"s:More detail.":[722.8605,0.8921],"s:Less detail.":[723.9526,0.924],"s:Normal detail.":[725.0765,1.027],"s:Okay.":[726.3035,0.6013],"s:Voice input isn't available in this browser. Type your question in Ask.":[727.1048,4.2185],"s:Hi, this is SeeForMe. Stairs down, about 3 meters. Handrail left.":[731.5233,4.5794],"s:Say see for me, then a command. For example: find a door. Start. Pause. Read. What's around me. Repeat. Mute. More detail. Flip camera. Or ask a question, like is there a chair.":[736.3027,12.0937],"s:Okay, I stopped looking.":[748.5963,1.4466],"s:I haven't said anything yet.":[750.243,1.4455],"s:I could not confirm anything on your left in the current camera view.":[751.8885,3.3786],"s:I could not confirm anything on your right in the current camera view.":[755.4671,3.5595],"s:I could not confirm objects in the current camera view. This does not mean the area is clear.":[759.2266,5.0937],"s:Camera on. Object detection is still loading.":[764.5203,2.7875],"s:Camera stopped.":[767.5078,0.918],"s:Stopped.":[768.6258,0.6495],"s:Still starting the camera. If the browser asks, allow camera access. Press Start again to cancel.":[769.4754,5.888],"s:Still switching the camera.":[775.5634,1.2937],"s:Switching camera.":[777.0572,0.962],"s:White cane: obstacle cues skip what your cane can reach and always warn at head height.":[778.2192,5.1119],"s:Guide dog: obstacle cues only warn at head height and buzz to stop.":[783.5311,4.1668],"s:No cane or guide dog: every obstacle cue from the depth map is said.":[787.8978,4.4464],"s:Reading text needs the SeeForMe server. Start it with make serve.":[792.5442,3.784],"s:Without the SeeForMe server I can only find common objects such as a chair, a person or a bottle. Signs and room numbers need the server.":[796.5283,8.6663],"s:Hands-free voice on.":[805.3946,1.2281],"s:Hands-free voice needs a browser with speech recognition (Chrome, Edge or Safari). Type in Ask instead.":[806.8227,6.6172],"s:Hands-free voice: tap anywhere or press a key to start listening.":[813.6399,3.692],"s:Talk uses your browser's speech recognition, which may send the audio to its speech service. Press Talk again to speak.":[817.5319,6.9493],"s:Microphone blocked: allow it in the browser's site settings to use voice.":[824.6812,4.2449],"s:Didn't hear anything. Press Talk and speak.":[829.126,2.2501],"s:Sorry, I didn't catch that.":[831.5762,1.5272],"s:The microphone is busy. Try again.":[833.3034,2.0971]}}